  "prefLabel": "Env-A 2902.22 Emissions tracking system (ETS)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2902.22 “Emissions tracking system (ETS)” means the computerized system operated and maintained by EPA for tracking emissions for the acid rain program and for tracking emissions from affected sources.\n\nSource. #10002, eff 10-1-11 (from Env-A 2903.23); ss by #12995, eff 2-25-20",
